<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-DAUGAVPILS UNCHANGED, UNIBANKA DIPS ON BOURSE.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-DAUGAVPILS UNCHANGED, UNIBANKA DIPS ON BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daugavpils Chain Maker was quoted</p>
<p>on the official list for the first time on Monday setting an</p>
<p>unchanged 1.10 lats price, the bourse said.</p>
<p>Unibanka also slid further in the wake of an announcement</p>
<p>last week that the privatisation agency is to sell one million</p>
<p>of its shares at a minimum 3.05 lats.</p>
